[ti:हर बार की कहानी]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Classical & Raga]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Piano E2 – rest – B2 – rest. Repeat. Silence 2 seconds. Tanpura enters.
[00:19.10]हर बार की कहानी में..
[00:30.21]क्या नया है जो सुनाए..
[00:41.31]प्यार बहुत होता है..
[00:52.42]जब तक पैसा बीच ना आए..
[01:03.52]Same story every time..
[01:14.63]What's new left to say?
[01:25.73]Love is easy, love is full..
[01:36.84]Till money finds its way.
[01:47.94]ना मैं सही ना तू गलत..
[01:59.05]सबको सिर्फ समय चलाए..
[02:10.15]I'm not right, you're not wrong..
[02:21.26]Time just drags us all along.
[02:32.36]क्या सच है क्या झूठ है..
[02:43.47]What is truth? What is a lie?
[02:54.57]Both together: Everyone decides what keeps them alive.
[03:05.68]जाने टूटे दिलों के टुकड़े..
[03:16.78]किसी और के आने से फिर जुड़ जाए..
[03:27.89]Broken hearts don't stay that way..
[03:38.99]Someone new walks in one day.
[03:50.10]Male: फिर धड़के दिल के तार..
[04:01.20]Female: The strings inside just start to play..
[04:12.30]Both unison: And love happens anyway.. फिर से प्यार यूं ही हो जाए..
[04:23.41]Hold final note 4 beats. Silence 2 beats.
[04:34.51]Male (spoken on pitch 3): लगा रह दिल किनारे से..
[04:45.62]Female (spoken one beat behind): Heart stays anchored to the shore..
[04:56.72]Male (half-sung 3-2-1): जाने कब तेरे नाम की लहर..
[05:07.83]Female (whispered): Waiting for your name.. a wave I've never seen before..
[05:18.93]Silence 3 seconds. Tanpura continues.
[05:30.04]Single piano note E2. Cello enters.
[05:41.14]Male (Hindi, warm, grounded):
[05:52.25]मत हो उदास ए दिल..
[06:03.35]ये खास नहीं है बात..
[06:14.46]Female (English, gentle, lullaby):
[06:25.56]Don't be sad, heart..
[06:36.67]This isn't special. This isn't new.
[06:47.77]Male: आएगा फिर सैलाब हार्मोन्स का..
[06:58.88]Female (underneath, softer): The flood will come again.. chemicals, waves, something true..
[07:09.98]Both unison (melody rises):
[07:21.09]तू रख पिया मिलन की आस..
[07:32.19]Female echoes one beat behind (English): keep the hope, keep the meeting, keep the you.
[07:43.30]आएगा..
